        <section class="faq-section">
            <div class="faq-container">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                    <p>Everything you need to know about heat pumps in Christchurch</p>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-list">
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question">
                            <span>What makes Alpha Heat Pumps different from other companies?</span>
                            <svg class="faq-question-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/>
                            </svg>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <div class="faq-answer-content">
                                <p>The Alpha Advantage is simple: we operate with lower overheads and smaller margins than traditional competitors, allowing us to pass genuine savings directly to you. As dedicated Daikin specialists with strong supplier relationships, we deliver premium quality at affordable prices without compromising on service or expertise. You get the best of both worlds—quality equipment and honest pricing from a local Christchurch team that cares.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question">
                            <span>Do you offer free quotes?</span>
                            <svg class="faq-question-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/>
                            </svg>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <div class="faq-answer-content">
                                <p>Yes! We offer completely free, no-obligation in-home consultations. Carl will visit your property, assess your heating and cooling needs, discuss your options, and provide a detailed quote. There's no pressure to proceed—we want you to make the right decision for your home or business.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question">
                            <span>Why do you only install Daikin heat pumps?</span>
                            <svg class="faq-question-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/>
                            </svg>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <div class="faq-answer-content">
                                <p>Daikin heat pumps are specifically rated for New Zealand's unique conditions—from our coastal humidity to our temperature variations. They offer superior energy efficiency, reliability, and quiet operation. As Daikin specialists, we have in-depth expertise with their systems and can secure better pricing through our high-volume purchasing power. Plus, Daikin backs their products with industry-leading warranties, giving you peace of mind.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question">
                            <span>Do you service commercial and industrial properties?</span>
                            <svg class="faq-question-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/>
                            </svg>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <div class="faq-answer-content">
                                <p>Absolutely. Our experienced team handles residential, commercial, and industrial projects of all sizes. We offer quarterly maintenance programs, BWOF compliance and sign-off, and comprehensive servicing for air conditioning, fresh air systems, and extract systems. Whether it's a single-room installation or a complex commercial system, we have the expertise to deliver quality results.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question">
                            <span>How often should I service my heat pump?</span>
                            <svg class="faq-question-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/>
                            </svg>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <div class="faq-answer-content">
                                <p>We recommend annual servicing to keep your heat pump running efficiently and extend its lifespan. Regular servicing includes filter cleaning, deep cleaning with antibacterial treatment, and checking all components for optimal performance. Professional maintenance improves efficiency, reduces energy costs, and maintains healthy indoor air quality. We include a complimentary 12-month service with all installations.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question">
                            <span>What areas do you cover?</span>
                            <svg class="faq-question-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/>
                            </svg>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <div class="faq-answer-content">
                                <p>We service all of Christchurch and Rolleston. As a local Christchurch business, we understand our climate and homes, and we're committed to providing fast, reliable service throughout our community. If you're unsure whether we cover your specific area, give us a call and we'll let you know.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
